<title>FRANCE: Dassault Aviation 1996 sales 13.0 bln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Dassault Aviation 1996 sales 13.0 bln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year to Dec 31,1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover				 13,000    vs   11,592</p>
<p>    Of which: fourth quarter	    4,397    vs    4,248</p>
